Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/foreign_try.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     val n = try compute();
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name @= value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name @= value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0014]: Jet does not use `try`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_try.jet:6:13
    |
  6 |     val n = try compute();
    |             ^^^
 Why: a call that can fail is marked with `?` after it, like `parse(x)?`
 Fix: write `parse(x)?` instead
